  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "opening",
          "mapId": 121,
          "bgmResourcePath": "BGM/101/BGM_1",
          "actorIds": [ "fala", "fanna", "fayina", "xiaoxiaokui", "buer", "bulutuo" ],
          "layout": {
            "actorSpacing": 150,
            "actorHeight": 238,
            "actorBottom": 166,
            "centerGap": 118,
            "stackOffset": 32
          }
        }
      ],
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "scene",
          "sceneId": "opening",
          "mapId": 121,
          "bgmResourcePath": "BGM/101/BGM_1"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "fala"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "fanna"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "fayina"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "xiaoxiaokui"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "buer"
        },
        {
          "type": "show",
          "actor": "bulutuo"
        },
        {
          "type": "narrate",
          "text": "异蘑世界的光从巨大蘑菇伞之间漏下来，像一盏被管理员调成柔光模式的星际探照灯。六名临时队员站在道路两侧，气氛庄重得像要开船，实际预算只够开会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "各位，欢迎参加阿卡迪亚星际巡查演示。首先声明：本活动不提供燃料、不提供发射台，也不提供事后写报告的心理咨询。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "buer",
          "text": "我只听见了不提供。那我们到底提供什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "提供想象力。以及一块写着“已检查”的蘑菇形记录板。它昨天还是餐盘，今天被提拔了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "choiceId": "start_route",
          "choices": [
            {
              "optionId": "ask_goal",
              "text": "认真询问巡查目标。"
            },
            {
              "optionId": "ask_ship",
              "text": "先质疑这艘“飞船”的合法性。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "ask_goal",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "start_route", "optionId": "ask_goal" }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "ask_ship",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "start_route", "optionId": "ask_ship" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_goal",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fanna",
          "text": "巡查目标是观察世界变化。最好远远地观察。越远越安全，越安全越像我在认真工作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "xiaoxiaokui",
          "text": "我也擅长和自然融合。只要大家不踩到我，我可以融合得非常彻底。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "choiceId": "goal_followup",
          "choices": [
            {
              "optionId": "nature_blend",
              "text": "询问小小葵的自然融入方案。"
            },
            {
              "optionId": "budget_contribution",
              "text": "询问右侧吐槽组的预算贡献。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "nature_blend",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "goal_followup", "optionId": "nature_blend" }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "budget_contribution",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "goal_followup", "optionId": "budget_contribution" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nature_blend",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "xiaoxiaokui",
          "text": "方案很简单：大家保持安静，我负责看起来像一片非常有事业心的叶子。如果敌人发现了我，就说明他们审美不错。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "briefing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "budget_contribution",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "buer",
          "text": "预算贡献？我可以贡献一个坐垫级安全缓冲和三句鼓舞士气的话。第四句要加班费。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "briefing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_ship",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "bulutuo",
          "text": "合法性？我坐过比这更可疑的交通工具。比如小树根。虽然它本人一直表示那不是交通工具。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "本船名叫蘑菇号，船体由路线图、巡查表和大家的配合组成。配合一散，船就地解体，俗称散会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "briefing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "briefing",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "narrate",
          "text": "法拉展开记录板，背面贴着一张手绘星图。星图右下角写着：如迷路，请先不要责怪星星。星星没有客服。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fayina",
          "text": "星空里有力量。也有沉默。还有一颗星刚刚眨了三下，可能是在提醒我们把表格写全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "buer",
          "text": "我可以负责安全。我的脂肪是有利的攻击武器，也是紧急缓冲垫。缺点是别人会以为我在偷懒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "很好。左侧是阿卡迪亚观察组，右侧是外勤吐槽组。请大家保持队形，不要把这件事变成跨地图聊天频道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "choiceId": "briefing_check",
          "choices": [
            {
              "optionId": "route_check",
              "text": "检查星际路线。"
            },
            {
              "optionId": "supply_check",
              "text": "检查临时补给。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "route_check",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "briefing_check", "optionId": "route_check" }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "supply_check",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "briefing_check", "optionId": "supply_check" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route_check",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "路线是这样的：从异蘑世界出发，绕开“星星在眨眼异常频繁区”，穿过“行政审批陨石带”，最后抵达据说很像目的地的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "xiaoxiaokui",
          "text": "据说很像目的地，这句话听起来非常冒险，也非常不想负责。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "signal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "supply_check",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fanna",
          "text": "补给清单：凉蘑菇两朵，备用任务日志十七本，一块写着“不要慌”的牌子。背面写着“如果已经慌了，请假装没有”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "bulutuo",
          "text": "我建议再加一项：如果飞船不能起飞，就宣布这是一次地面沉浸式训练。听起来立刻专业很多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "signal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "signal",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fayina",
          "text": "星星回应了。它说：请确认乘员是否真的知道自己在做什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "不用太正式。星际冒险经费有限，彩虹屁也可以走简易报销。现在，选择通信方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "choiceId": "signal_method",
          "choices": [
            {
              "optionId": "blink_signal",
              "text": "用星星眨眼发信号。"
            },
            {
              "optionId": "mushroom_channel",
              "text": "用蘑菇频道发信号。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "blink_signal",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "signal_method", "optionId": "blink_signal" }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "mushroom_channel",
          "condition": {
            "operatorType": "AND",
            "conditions": [
              { "type": "ChoiceSelected", "choiceId": "signal_method", "optionId": "mushroom_channel" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "blink_signal",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fayina",
          "text": "三短一长表示你好，一长三短表示你站错航道。如果一直亮着，那就是星星也不知道该怎么办。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "ending"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mushroom_channel",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "xiaoxiaokui",
          "text": "蘑菇频道稳定，缺点是延迟高。毕竟孢子没有加班费，传消息全靠自觉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "jump",
          "target": "ending"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "commands": [
        {
          "type": "narrate",
          "text": "临时巡查队完成了全部流程。星星眨了一下，蘑菇轻轻晃动，记录板上“已检查”三个字显得格外可靠，虽然它还是很像餐盘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "fala",
          "text": "演示结论：你适合太空冒险。优点是愿意听指挥，缺点是太愿意听我讲安全须知。正常人听到行政审批陨石带时就该后退了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "actor": "bulutuo",
          "text": "我给这次任务打八分。扣两分是因为飞船没有真的飞，但加回来一分，因为不用写坠落报告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "args": "10001 complete"
        },
        {
          "type": "teleport",
          "args": "121"
        },
        {
          "type": "end"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
